<title>USA: Netanyahu arrives in U.S.for summit.</title>
<headline>Netanyahu arrives in U.S.for summit.</headline>
<dateline>ANDREWS AIR FORCE BASE, Va. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu arrived in the United States on Monday night for an emergency Arab-Israeli summit called to end an explosion of violence.</p>
<p>On his way to the two-day summit called by President Bill Clinton, Nentanyahu called for non-stop negotiations with the Palestinians on an Israeli pullout from parts of the troubled West Bank town of Hebron delayed since March by suicide bombings and Israei security concerns.</p>
</text>
